      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Alloying a refractory high-entropy alloy with Hf can improve its high-temperature oxygen resistance.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed improvement should occur above 800 °C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf alloying can promote precipitation of Ni7Hf2 intermetallic compounds.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "node::10.1016/j.msea.2020.139820",
        "node::10.1016/j.jallcom.2020.154159"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf alloying can promote precipitation of Laves phases.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "node::10.1016/j.msea.2020.139820",
        "node::10.1016/j.jallcom.2020.154159"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The precipitated intermetallic compounds can act as barriers to oxygen diffusion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Restricting oxygen diffusion through the alloy will improve its high-temperature oxygen resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf-alloyed material will have better high-temperature oxygen resistance than the untreated refractory high-entropy alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed effect applies in an oxygen-rich atmosphere.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
